  "html": "<div class=\"task note-list\"><h3>Questions 21–25</h3><p class=\"instructions\">Choose the correct answer.</p><h4 class=\"task-title\">Training course for language teachers</h4><div class=\"mc-question\" id=\"q21\" data-q=\"21\"><div class=\"mc-header\"><span class=\"mc-num\">21</span><span class=\"mc-stmt\">In weeks one and two of their teaching practice, David and Julia took an active part in</span></div><div class=\"mc-options\"><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q21\" data-q=\"21\" value=\"A\" aria-label=\"Question 21, teaching certain classes.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>teaching certain classes.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q21\" data-q=\"21\" value=\"B\" aria-label=\"Question 21, marking students’ work.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>marking students’ work.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q21\" data-q=\"21\" value=\"C\" aria-label=\"Question 21, planning lessons.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>planning lessons.</span></label></div></div><div class=\"mc-question\" id=\"q22\" data-q=\"22\"><div class=\"mc-header\"><span class=\"mc-num\">22</span><span class=\"mc-stmt\">Which part of the university course proved most useful on their teaching practice?</span></div><div class=\"mc-options\"><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q22\" data-q=\"22\" value=\"A\" aria-label=\"Question 22, Teaching Resources\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>Teaching Resources</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q22\" data-q=\"22\" value=\"B\" aria-label=\"Question 22, Pupil Behaviour\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>Pupil Behaviour</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q22\" data-q=\"22\" value=\"C\" aria-label=\"Question 22, Language Improvement\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>Language Improvement</span></label></div></div><div class=\"mc-question\" id=\"q23\" data-q=\"23\"><div class=\"mc-header\"><span class=\"mc-num\">23</span><span class=\"mc-stmt\">The biggest initial problem for David and Julia was</span></div><div class=\"mc-options\"><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q23\" data-q=\"23\" value=\"A\" aria-label=\"Question 23, the wide age range.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>the wide age range.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q23\" data-q=\"23\" value=\"B\" aria-label=\"Question 23, different abilities within classes.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>different abilities within classes.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q23\" data-q=\"23\" value=\"C\" aria-label=\"Question 23, the students ignoring them.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>the students ignoring them.</span></label></div></div><div class=\"mc-question\" id=\"q24\" data-q=\"24\"><div class=\"mc-header\"><span class=\"mc-num\">24</span><span class=\"mc-stmt\">What feedback did Mrs Lucas give David after watching him teach?</span></div><div class=\"mc-options\"><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q24\" data-q=\"24\" value=\"A\" aria-label=\"Question 24, Be more flexible during lessons.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>Be more flexible during lessons.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q24\" data-q=\"24\" value=\"B\" aria-label=\"Question 24, Spend more time planning.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>Spend more time planning.</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q24\" data-q=\"24\" value=\"C\" aria-label=\"Question 24, Don’t allow students to use their first language.\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>Don’t allow students to use their first language.</span></label></div></div><div class=\"mc-question\" id=\"q25\" data-q=\"25\"><div class=\"mc-header\"><span class=\"mc-num\">25</span><span class=\"mc-stmt\">How did Julia feel when she was formally assessed?</span></div><div class=\"mc-options\"><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q25\" data-q=\"25\" value=\"A\" aria-label=\"Question 25, under-prepared\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>under-prepared</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q25\" data-q=\"25\" value=\"B\" aria-label=\"Question 25, relatively confident\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>relatively confident</span></label><label class=\"mc-opt-lbl\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q25\" data-q=\"25\" value=\"C\" aria-label=\"Question 25, aware of seeming nervous\"><span class=\"mc-radio-circ\"></span><span>aware of seeming nervous</span></label></div></div></div><div class=\"task note-list\"><h3>Questions 26–30</h3><p class=\"instructions\">What did the trainee teachers learn from observing each of the following lessons? Choose <strong>FIVE</strong> answers from the list and move each answer into the correct gap.</p><div class=\"match-layout\"><div><h4>Lessons</h4><div class=\"form-row \">French (Mrs Potts) <span class=\"me-drop sample-drop\" id=\"q26\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-q=\"26\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Question 26, choose an answer\"><span class=\"sample-number me-num\">26</span><span class=\"sample-filled\"></span></span></div><div class=\"form-row \">Spanish (Mr Norton) <span class=\"me-drop sample-drop\" id=\"q27\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-q=\"27\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Question 27, choose an answer\"><span class=\"sample-number me-num\">27</span><span class=\"sample-filled\"></span></span></div><div class=\"form-row \">Russian (Mr Norton) <span class=\"me-drop sample-drop\" id=\"q28\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-q=\"28\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Question 28, choose an answer\"><span class=\"sample-number me-num\">28</span><span class=\"sample-filled\"></span></span></div><div class=\"form-row \">Spanish (Mrs Lucas) <span class=\"me-drop sample-drop\" id=\"q29\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-q=\"29\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Question 29, choose an answer\"><span class=\"sample-number me-num\">29</span><span class=\"sample-filled\"></span></span></div><div class=\"form-row \">French (Mr Shaw) <span class=\"me-drop sample-drop\" id=\"q30\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-q=\"30\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Question 30, choose an answer\"><span class=\"sample-number me-num\">30</span><span class=\"sample-filled\"></span></span></div></div><div><h4>What the trainee teachers learned</h4><div class=\"me-endingbank sample-bank\" data-kind=\"sections\"><button class=\"me-ending sample-token\" type=\"button\" draggable=\"false\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-value=\"A\">use reference materials if necessary</button><button class=\"me-ending sample-token\" type=\"button\" draggable=\"false\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-value=\"B\">deal with problem students quickly</button><button class=\"me-ending sample-token\" type=\"button\" draggable=\"false\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-value=\"C\">use personal information about students</button><button class=\"me-ending sample-token\" type=\"button\" draggable=\"false\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-value=\"D\">vary the loudness of your voice</button><button class=\"me-ending sample-token\" type=\"button\" draggable=\"false\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-value=\"E\">let students work things out</button><button class=\"me-ending sample-token\" type=\"button\" draggable=\"false\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-value=\"F\">be aware of everyone in the class</button><button class=\"me-ending sample-token\" type=\"button\" draggable=\"false\" data-kind=\"sections\" data-value=\"G\">position yourself correctly</button></div></div></div></div>",
